  "body": "If your family is needing more space, 20 Spyglass Street is the kind of home that changes the game completely. Nearly 400sqm of beautifully considered living, six bedrooms, three of which include ensuites, multiple living areas and sea views, all tucked privately down a right of way at the end of a cul-de-sac. It's big enough for the whole crew, flexible enough for guests, work and teenagers, and still gives everyone somewhere to escape.\r\n\r\nFeatures you'll love:\r\n* 618sqm freehold section with fully fenced back yard\r\n* Six bedrooms, including three with ensuite bathrooms\r\n* Five beautifully appointed bathrooms plus a sixth guest toilet\r\n* Designer kitchen with large butlers pantry including second hob\r\n* Built-in coffee machine and wine fridge\r\n* Multiple living areas with plenty of space to spread out\r\n* High-stud ceilings and generous open-plan living\r\n* Upstairs balcony with sea views\r\n* Private backyard with two garden sheds\r\n* Ducted central heating and cooling plus underfloor heating\r\n* Bluetooth enabled sound system with built in speakers \r\n* Central vacuum system and intercom\r\n* Plenty of off-street parking for extra vehicles\r\n* Private position at the end of a cul-de-sac\r\n\r\nPositioned in sought-after Silverdale, close to local schools, Silverdale shops and amenities, with easy access to the motorway and some of the Hibiscus Coast's best beaches. It's a location that makes everyday family life easier while keeping the coast and everything you need close by.\r\n\r\nIf you need more space, more flexibility and a home that can genuinely keep up with family life, come and experience 20 Spyglass for yourself. We'll see you soon.\r\n\r\nTo download the property documents visit: https://www.harcourtsfiles.co.nz/listings/NEWJ\r\n\r\nFlexible settlement terms available.\r\nOther agents - bring your buyers. Conjunctionals welcome.",
